<title>FRANCE: Government re-affirms support for Thomson head.</title>
<headline>Government re-affirms support for Thomson head.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Defence Ministry said on Tuesday the government was maintaining its fullest confidence in Marcel Roulet, chairman of Thomson SA and Thomson-CSF.</p>
<p>&quot;Thomson-CSF, one of the best performing defence companies in Europe and the world, is at the heart of the restructuring of the French industry landscape,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
